      "description": "Dry chemicals must be wetted evenly and dissolved without lumps (\"fish-eyes\" with polymer). The feeder doses powder in proportion to the dilution water to reach the target strength (polymer often ~ 0.1–0.5 %, lime milk ~ 5–10 %). Polymer solutions need gentle mixing and ageing time (~ 30–60 min) to fully uncoil before use.",
